Z||000000||My7Fieros||08-25-2001||04:54 PM||||Memphis now has an NBA team, the Grizzlies. They just moved here from Canada. Not the greatest team by any stretch, but hell who cares, its NBA!! Now we have to build a new arena (its already been approved and building begins within the next couple of weeks) because the 47 million coliseums we have here arent good enough I guess.. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><BR>Sorry to those in Canada (cant remember what city) who lost them..your loss is our gain. <BR>Its really cool because after years and years of trying to get NFL here, we FINALLY got it, only for them to play in Nashville!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"> So NBA here is cool! To those of you who live in a city that already has an NBA team I know this isnt a big deal but it is here......just thought I'd share. <P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I>||||reg||14
